// The Lattice Spire layout (WP-067): greybox blocks (scaled `block_unit`, centered on `pos`).
// Meters, Y is up. The tower is a 20 m square at the
// origin, a solid base up to y = 7 (floor 1) with walled floors above it, 5 m apart:
//   F1 y = 7   Verge and Mirrormere elites      F2 y = 12  Hollowdeep and Castle elites
//   F3 y = 17  Rimeshelf elites, Lantern L23    arena y = 22  the Unspooled's roof (B12)
// The outer spiral is a clockwise stair of flat 3.5-4.5 m landings (0.3 m risers) hugging the tower,
// 4 m wide, from the gate's forecourt (x 0..4, z -14..-10, ground) to F1's south door (x 6.5..9.5):
// three 2.5 m gaps (pits up to 3 m deep), each with a fallback ladder on its far face. Stairs inside: F1
// to F2 along the east wall, F2 to F3 along the north wall, F3 to the arena along the south wall
// (a walled corridor ending in the fog gate at z = -5.25, x 5..8).
// The Spire's silhouette (spire_*) stands behind the arena's north rim, 80 m tall.
